Description:It is your second main phase. You are at 20 life and control Valakut, the Molten Pinnacle, Akoum Hellkite, Retreat to Coralhelm, Prodigal Pyromancer and four Mountains and one Forest, all untapped. Your hand is Azusa, Lost but Seeking, Blaze, Harrow, Lotus Cobra, Mountain, Tunneling Geopede and Wooded Foothills. Your library holds five Mountains and five Forests. The opponent is at 33 life and controls nothing. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
